{"page":587,"width":1654,"height":2463,"text_angle":0,"lines":[{"text":"650","words":[{"text":"650","x":176,"y":138,"width":57,"height":29}]},{"text":"14.9","words":[{"text":"14.9","x":171,"y":624,"width":94,"height":34}]},{"text":"Chapter 14 파일 시스템 구현","words":[{"text":"Chapter","x":302,"y":141,"width":114,"height":27},{"text":"14","x":429,"y":143,"width":34,"height":20},{"text":"파일","x":491,"y":141,"width":40,"height":25},{"text":"시스템","x":540,"y":142,"width":60,"height":24},{"text":"구현","x":609,"y":142,"width":39,"height":25}]},{"text":"이러한 중복은 Al#(disaster) 복구에 시용된다. 첫 번째 시스템이 폐기되어아 한다면","words":[{"text":"이러한","x":305,"y":262,"width":91,"height":34},{"text":"중복은","x":410,"y":263,"width":89,"height":34},{"text":"Al#(disaster)","x":514,"y":263,"width":193,"height":38},{"text":"복구에","x":723,"y":265,"width":85,"height":35},{"text":"시용된다.","x":825,"y":266,"width":124,"height":34},{"text":"첫","x":969,"y":267,"width":26,"height":34},{"text":"번째","x":1014,"y":267,"width":57,"height":34},{"text":"시스템이","x":1091,"y":268,"width":125,"height":34},{"text":"폐기되어아","x":1238,"y":267,"width":164,"height":35},{"text":"한다면","x":1417,"y":267,"width":88,"height":34}]},{"text":"데이터의 거의 대부분을 원격 시스템에서 찾을 수 있다.","words":[{"text":"데이터의","x":304,"y":319,"width":118,"height":35},{"text":"거의","x":437,"y":320,"width":54,"height":34},{"text":"대부분을","x":505,"y":320,"width":115,"height":34},{"text":"원격","x":632,"y":320,"width":52,"height":34},{"text":"시스템에서","x":700,"y":321,"width":140,"height":36},{"text":"찾을","x":856,"y":322,"width":58,"height":34},{"text":"수","x":924,"y":323,"width":30,"height":33},{"text":"있다.","x":967,"y":323,"width":65,"height":33}]},{"text":"마지막으로 ZFS 파일 시스템도 유사한 방식으로 효율적인 스냅숏, 클론과 중복과","words":[{"text":"마지막으로","x":361,"y":376,"width":148,"height":34},{"text":"ZFS","x":522,"y":379,"width":58,"height":28},{"text":"파일","x":595,"y":376,"width":56,"height":34},{"text":"시스템도","x":668,"y":377,"width":115,"height":34},{"text":"유사한","x":797,"y":378,"width":88,"height":35},{"text":"방식으로","x":899,"y":378,"width":121,"height":34},{"text":"효율적인","x":1035,"y":379,"width":126,"height":34},{"text":"스냅숏,","x":1179,"y":380,"width":107,"height":34},{"text":"클론과","x":1304,"y":380,"width":99,"height":33},{"text":"중복과","x":1417,"y":379,"width":92,"height":34}]},{"text":"시간이 흐를수록 다양한 파일 시스템에서 점점 보편화되는 이러한 기능을 제공한다는","words":[{"text":"시간이","x":304,"y":433,"width":87,"height":34},{"text":"흐를수록","x":409,"y":433,"width":118,"height":34},{"text":"다양한","x":542,"y":433,"width":87,"height":34},{"text":"파일","x":642,"y":433,"width":56,"height":35},{"text":"시스템에서","x":715,"y":434,"width":142,"height":35},{"text":"점점","x":877,"y":434,"width":54,"height":34},{"text":"보편화되는","x":949,"y":434,"width":157,"height":35},{"text":"이러한","x":1123,"y":435,"width":98,"height":35},{"text":"기능을","x":1239,"y":435,"width":97,"height":34},{"text":"제공한다는","x":1354,"y":435,"width":155,"height":34}]},{"text":"것에 유의해야 한다","words":[{"text":"것에","x":305,"y":490,"width":56,"height":33},{"text":"유의해야","x":374,"y":490,"width":119,"height":33},{"text":"한다","x":503,"y":489,"width":64,"height":33}]},{"text":"요약 Summary","words":[{"text":"요약","x":320,"y":621,"width":72,"height":39},{"text":"Summary","x":417,"y":631,"width":157,"height":29}]},{"text":"• 대부분의 파일 시스템은 보조저장장지에 상주하여 많은 양의 데이터를 영구적으로","words":[{"text":"•","x":320,"y":719,"width":14,"height":14},{"text":"대부분의","x":358,"y":710,"width":115,"height":34},{"text":"파일","x":489,"y":711,"width":56,"height":33},{"text":"시스템은","x":561,"y":710,"width":114,"height":34},{"text":"보조저장장지에","x":688,"y":710,"width":204,"height":36},{"text":"상주하여","x":908,"y":712,"width":119,"height":33},{"text":"많은","x":1046,"y":711,"width":63,"height":34},{"text":"양의","x":1124,"y":712,"width":61,"height":34},{"text":"데이터를","x":1205,"y":712,"width":132,"height":34},{"text":"영구적으로","x":1355,"y":712,"width":153,"height":33}]},{"text":"보유하도록 설계된다. 가장 일반적인 보조저장 매체는 디스크이지만 NVM 장치의","words":[{"text":"보유하도록","x":356,"y":768,"width":149,"height":34},{"text":"설계된다.","x":518,"y"