eight":34}]},{"text":"기텍처에 마운트되어 시용할 수 있다.","words":[{"text":"기텍처에","x":357,"y":1002,"width":113,"height":36},{"text":"마운트되어","x":482,"y":1002,"width":141,"height":34},{"text":"시용할","x":637,"y":1001,"width":88,"height":35},{"text":"수","x":734,"y":1002,"width":30,"height":34},{"text":"있다.","x":777,"y":1002,"width":62,"height":35}]},{"text":"• 파일 시스템은 종종 계층 또는 모듈 구조로 구현된다. 낮은 수준은 저장장치의 물리","words":[{"text":"•","x":319,"y":1080,"width":14,"height":13},{"text":"파일","x":355,"y":1070,"width":57,"height":34},{"text":"시스템은","x":426,"y":1069,"width":115,"height":34},{"text":"종종","x":552,"y":1070,"width":58,"height":33},{"text":"계층","x":622,"y":1069,"width":57,"height":34},{"text":"또는","x":690,"y":1070,"width":59,"height":31},{"text":"모듈","x":760,"y":1071,"width":60,"height":31},{"text":"구조로","x":831,"y":1072,"width":90,"height":31},{"text":"구현된다.","x":933,"y":1069,"width":132,"height":35},{"text":"낮은","x":1081,"y":1069,"width":65,"height":34},{"text":"수준은","x":1158,"y":1070,"width":101,"height":34},{"text":"저장장치의","x":1273,"y":1070,"width":159,"height":34},{"text":"물리","x":1448,"y":1071,"width":56,"height":33}]},{"text":"적 속성과 통신을 처리한다. 상위 레벨은 심볼릭 파일 이름 및 파일의 논리적 특성을","words":[{"text":"적","x":356,"y":1128,"width":24,"height":32},{"text":"속성과","x":394,"y":1126,"width":89,"height":34},{"text":"통신을","x":491,"y":1126,"width":88,"height":34},{"text":"처리한다.","x":590,"y":1126,"width":121,"height":34},{"text":"상위","x":723,"y":1125,"width":57,"height":34},{"text":"레벨은","x":795,"y":1126,"width":89,"height":34},{"text":"심볼릭","x":895,"y":1126,"width":87,"height":34},{"text":"파일","x":997,"y":1127,"width":61,"height":33},{"text":"이름","x":1074,"y":1126,"width":63,"height":34},{"text":"및","x":1150,"y":1127,"width":29,"height":33},{"text":"파일의","x":1193,"y":1127,"width":97,"height":33},{"text":"논리적","x":1305,"y":1127,"width":96,"height":33},{"text":"특성을","x":1416,"y":1126,"width":92,"height":34}]},{"text":"처리한다.","words":[{"text":"처리한다.","x":356,"y":1183,"width":122,"height":35}]},{"text":"• 파일 시스템 내의 다양한 파일은 세 가지 방식 연속, 연결 또는 색인 할당을 통해 저","words":[{"text":"•","x":319,"y":1261,"width":13,"height":13},{"text":"파일","x":354,"y":1251,"width":57,"height":34},{"text":"시스템","x":425,"y":1250,"width":84,"height":34},{"text":"내의","x":523,"y":1250,"width":54,"height":34},{"text":"다양한","x":590,"y":1250,"width":88,"height":34},{"text":"파일은","x":688,"y":1249,"width":89,"height":35},{"text":"세","x":788,"y":1250,"width":27,"height":34},{"text":"가지","x":830,"y":1250,"width":55,"height":34},{"text":"방식","x":900,"y":1249,"width":58,"height":35},{"text":"연속,","x":976,"y":1250,"width":68,"height":35},{"text":"연결","x":1060,"y":1250,"width":60,"height":34},{"text":"또는","x":1135,"y":1252,"width":67,"height":31},{"text":"색인","x":1214,"y":1250,"width":65,"height":33},{"text":"할당을","x":1292,"y":1249,"width":100,"height":34},{"text":"통해","x":1403,"y":1249,"width":62,"height":34},{"text":"저","x":1480,"y":1249,"width":24,"height":34}]},{"text":"장장치의 공간에 할당될 수 있다. 연속 할당으로 인해 외부 단편화가 큰 문제이다.","words":[{"text":"장장치의","x":355,"y":1308,"width":114,"height":35},{"text":"공간에","x":485,"y":1308,"width":84,"height":34},{"text":"할당될","x":584,"y":1307,"width":85,"height":34},{"text":"수","x":684,"y":1307,"width":30,"height":34},{"text":"있다.","x":730,"y":1307,"width":62,"height":35},{"text":"연속","x":811,"y":1307,"width":58,"height":34},{"text":"할당으로","x":882,"y":1307,"width":124,"height":34},{"text":"인해","x":1023,"y":1307,"width":58,"height":35},{"text":"외부","x":1100,"y":1307,"width":65,"height":35},{"text":"단편화가","x":1180,"y":1306,"width":133,"height":35},{"text":"큰","x":1326,"y":1309,"width":35,"height":30},{"text":"문제이다.","x":1376,"y":1306,"width":130,"height":34}]},{"text":"직접 접근은 연결 할당 방식에서 매우 비효율적이다. 색인 할당에는 색인 블록에 대","words":[{"text":"직접","x":357,"y":1366,"width":53,"height":34},{"text":"접근은","x":427,"y":1366,"width":87,"height":33},{"text":"연결","x":526,"y":1365,"width":54,"height":34},{"text":"할당","x":592,"y":1365,"width":58,"height":35},{"text":"방식에서","x":662,"y":1364,"width":113,"height":35},{"text":"매우","x":791,"y":1365,"width":60,"height":35},{"text":"비효율적이다.","x":864,"y":1365,"width":190,"height":35},{"text":"색인","x":1069,"y":1365,"width":63,"height":34},{"text":"할당에는","x":1146,"y":1364,"width":133,"height":34},{"text":"색인","x":1292,"y":1363,"width":64,"height":34},{"text":"블록에","x":1370,"y":1362,"width":94,"height":34},{"text":"대","x":1480,"y":1363,"width":24,"height":34}]},{"text":"한 상당한 오버헤드가 필요할 수 있다. 이 알고리즘은 여러 가지 방법으로 최적회될","words":[{"text":"한","x":355,"y":1424,"width":31,"height":33},{"text":"상당한","x":396,"y":1423,"width":89,"height":34},{"text":"오버헤드가","x":495,"y":1423,"width":145,"height":35},{"text":"필요할","x":651,"y":1423,"width":88,"height":33},{"text":"수","x":749,"y":1423,"width":30,"height":34},{"text":"있다.","x":793,"y":1423,"width":64,"height":34},{"text":"이","x":873,"y":1423,"width":24,"height":34},{"text":"알고리즘은","x":914,"y":1423,"width":156,"height":33},{"text":"여러","x":1084,"y":1422,"width":59,"height":34},{"text":"가지","x":1161,"y":1421,"width":60,"height":35},{"text":"방법으로","x":1239,"y":1420,"width":132,"height":34},{"text":"최적회될","x":1385,"y":1419,"width":120,"height":35}]},{"text":"수 있다. 유연성을 높이고 외부 단편화를 줄이기 위해 연속 할당은 익스텐트를 통해","words":[{"text":"수","x":355,"y":1481,"width":31,"height":34},{"text":"있다.","x":399,"y":1481,"width":63,"height":34},{"text":"유연성을","x":475,"y":1481,"width":115,"height":34},{"text":"높이고","x":600,"y":1480,"width":87,"height":34},{"text":"외부","x":700,"y":1480,"width":58,"height":34},{"text":"단편화를","x":769,"y":1481,"width":121,"height":34},{"text":"줄이기","x":901,"y":1480,"width":89,"height":34},{"text":"위해","x":1007,"y":1480,"width":60,"height":34},{"text":"연속","x":1085,"y":1479,"width":63,"height":33},{"text":"할당은","x":1160,"y":1478,"width":100,"height":35},{"text":"익스텐트를","x":1274,"y":1477,"width":163,"height":34},{"text":"통해","x":1448,"y":1477,"width":57,"height":34}]},{"text":"확장될 수 있다. 처리량을 늘리고 필요한 인덱스 항목 수를 줄이기 위해 여러 블록의","words":[{"text":"확장될","x":356,"y":1538,"width":86,"height":34},{"text":"수","x":454,"y":1539,"width":30,"height":33},{"text":"있다.","x":496,"y":1538,"width":61,"height":35},{"text":"처리량을","x":571,"y":1537,"width":114,"height":35},{"text":"늘리고","x":694,"y":1537,"width":90,"height":34},{"text":"필요한","x":796,"y":1538,"width":90,"height":33},{"text":"인덱스","x":899,"y":1538,"width":89,"height":33},{"text":"항목","x":999,"y":1537,"width":64,"height":34},{"text":"수를","x":1073,"y":1537,"width":66,"height":34},{"text":"줄이기","x":1150,"y":1536,"width":95,"height":34},{"text":"위해","x":1263,"y":1535,"width":62,"height":34},{"text":"여러","x":1342,"y":1534,"width":60,"height":34},{"text":"블록의","x":1416,"y":1534,"width":89,"height":34}]},{"text":"집합인 클러스터 단위로 색인 할당될 수 있다. 대규모 클러스터에서의 색인은 익스","words":[{"text":"집합인","x":357,"y":1595,"width":86,"height":33},{"text":"클러스터","x":457,"y":1596,"width":111,"height":34},{"text":"단위로","x":584,"y":1595,"width":86,"height":34},{"text":"색인","x":683,"y":1595,"width":57,"height":34},{"text":"할당될","x":754,"y":1595,"width":88,"height":34},{"text":"수","x":856,"y":1595,"width":31,"height":35},{"text":"있다.","x":902,"y":1594,"width":65,"height":35},{"text":"대규모","x":985,"y":1595,"width":94,"height":34},{"text":"클러스터에서의","x":1092,"y":1592,"width":227,"height":36},{"text":"색인은","x":1337,"y":1592,"width":99,"height":34},{"text":"익스","x":1451,"y":1592,"width":57,"height":33}]},{"text":"텐트를 사용한 연속 할당과 유사하다.","words":[{"text":"텐트를","x":357,"y":1652,"width":88,"height":33},{"text":"사용한","x":454,"y":1652,"width":88,"height":34},{"text":"연속","x":552,"y":1653,"width":56,"height":33},{"text":"할당과","x":617,"y":1652,"width":88,"height":34},{"text":"유사하다.","x":714,"y":1653,"width":126,"height":34}]},{"text":"• 가용 공간 할당 방법은 디스크 공간 사우 효율성, 파일 시스템 성능 및 보조 저장장","words":[{"text":"•","x":317,"y":1726,"width":14,"height":14},{"text":"가용","x":356,"y":1719,"width":59,"height":33},{"text":"공간","x":426,"y":1718,"width":59,"height":34},{"text":"할당","x":496,"y":1719,"width":58,"height":34},{"text":"방법은","x":565,"y":1720,"width":86,"height":33},{"text":"디스크",